1
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:37,200
That blind man irritates me just by looking at him

2
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:39,440
You'll impersonate me to accompany Li Zhi'an

3
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:41,600
Quickly find out the whereabouts of the Dragon Jade

4
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:43,400
Understood

5
00:00:44,760 --> 00:00:46,200
Don't say big brother doesn't care for you

6
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:48,200
Here's your reward of Wushi Powder

7
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:50,280
Once we locate the Dragon Jade

8
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:53,640
You'll have all the Wushi Powder you need

9
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:55,600
Thank you, Imperial Brother

10
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:05,640
You're the clever one

11
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:07,840
When we return to Nanliang

12
00:01:08,440 --> 00:01:10,520
You'll continue as my estate steward

13
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:13,520
And help me teach that damned blind man a lesson

14
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:29,480
Is... is that you, my lord?

15
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:32,200
It's me, Zhi'an

16
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:34,920
But he's clearly Zhu Huaijin

17
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:36,120
Why would he deceive me?

18
00:01:37,480 --> 00:01:39,000
I'm his sister-in-law

19
00:01:39,320 --> 00:01:40,840
How dare he enter my carriage

20
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:55,120
Are you alright, Zhi'an?

21
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:56,040
I'm fine

22
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:00,160
Why is he looking at me like that?

23
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:09,200
This voice sounds so much like the person I've been with day and night

24
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:13,320
Could it be that Zhu Huaijin has been by my side all along?

25
00:02:15,880 --> 00:02:18,680
Zhu Huaichen, how dare you deceive and humiliate me like this!

26
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:34,400
Zhi'an, why are your hands so cold?

27
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,560
What is this?

28
00:02:42,320 --> 00:02:43,920
It was given to me by my mother

29
00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:45,920
As I'm about to leave my hometown

30
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:47,280
I find myself missing her

31
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,160
Don't worry

32
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:53,200
I'll treat you well

33
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:56,160
Alright

34
00:02:56,720 --> 00:03:00,120
You despicable scoundrel! May you die a horrible death!

35
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:01,880
Zhi'an

36
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:05,480
Are you being so gentle now because you think I'm Zhu Huaichen?

37
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:08,160
He's not worthy of your devotion

38
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,720
I'll leave you here

39
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:25,120
Go in by yourself

40
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:35,160
They took advantage of my blindness

41
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:37,720
And made me live in such a dim, eerie

42
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:39,400
And dilapidated place

43
00:03:50,640 --> 00:03:51,440
This gives me

44
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:59,760
The North Courtyard is where servants live

45
00:03:59,760 --> 00:04:02,000
Why was the imperial princess consort arranged to stay here?

46
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:03,240
Didn't you see earlier?

47
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,600
The princess consort is blind

48
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:05,560
Whether living in South or North Courtyard

49
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,280
makes no difference anyway

50
00:04:06,640 --> 00:04:07,960
What princess consort?

51
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:10,960
I think that Steward Duan is the real mistress here

52
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:12,400
It's improper for you to gossip about your masters like this

53
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,680
That's quite inappropriate

54
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:14,920
Oh don't worry

55
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,400
Damn blind woman

56
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,680
Know your place

57
00:04:58,640 --> 00:04:59,760
Princess Consort

58
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:03,880
This servant was specially assigned by Steward Duan to attend to you

59
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:06,600
You may call me Nanny Qin

60
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:10,360
Meeting familiar faces so soon

61
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:16,400
Princess Consort, you must be exhausted from the journey

62
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:22,240
Please have some tea

63
00:05:29,760 --> 00:05:32,000
So this is how you treat me

64
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,040
Please, have a seat.

65
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:50,160
From now on, you are under my protection.

66
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,560
I come from a military family

67
00:05:53,080 --> 00:05:54,560
and have witnessed life and death on the battlefield.

68
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:58,760
I know that social status means nothing in the grand scheme.

69
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:00,640
Every life is precious.

70
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:03,200
As long as one lives, there's always a chance to change their destiny.

71
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:05,560
I understand servants in wealthy households

72
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,560
often curry favor with the powerful

73
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:08,840
while living in constant fear.

74
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:12,040
In my quarters, such behavior isn't necessary.

75
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:14,680
Though I cannot see,

76
00:06:14,960 --> 00:06:17,040
I won't tolerate those who play both sides.

77
00:06:17,440 --> 00:06:19,760
Those who harm me will face consequences,

78
00:06:20,320 --> 00:06:22,640
and I'll protect those who stand by me with all my might.

79
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:27,040
From now on, you may work according to your conscience.

80
00:06:27,840 --> 00:06:28,520
If anyone wishes to leave,

81
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:30,080
you may do so now.

82
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:31,120
For those who choose to stay,

83
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:33,600
when you reach an age where you no longer wish to serve,

84
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:36,240
I'll provide for your retirement.

85
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:38,680
But remember this first

86
00:06:39,520 --> 00:06:40,840
You all belong to me

87
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:42,440
I'm making this clear

88
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:47,640
The Crown Princess is truly kind

89
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,800
If I had been born decades earlier

90
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:53,120
I would have begged you to arrange a good marriage for me

91
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,440
You should drink your tea first

92
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:58,240
Your tea has gone cold, Crown Princess

93
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,920
Let me bring you a fresh cup

94
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,440
It's quite alright

95
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:05,120
Pouring it out would waste this fine tea

96
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:06,280
But...

97
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:09,920
Ah, our Crown Princess is thrifty and economical

98
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,840
What's with all your 'buts', girl?

99
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:16,800
What's wrong?

100
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:19,120
Why are you kneeling?

101
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:22,120
Then I'll give this tea to you as a reward

102
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:43,320
Nanny Qin, why did you call out?

103
00:07:45,760 --> 00:07:46,560
No...

104
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:47,640
It's nothing

105
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:50,400
Thank you for the tea, my lady

106
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:54,160
The servants in the prince's residence are truly disciplined

107
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:57,080
Quickly bring me my dowry chest

108
00:07:57,080 --> 00:07:59,200
I'll take some things to reward you all

109
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:03,560
Keep your voice down

110
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:05,760
Don't make any noise that might alert the princess consort

111
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,120
You scared me to death

112
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:18,960
How can this woman be so formidable

113
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:20,440
Could it be

114
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,880
Could she be pretending to be blind

115
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:30,240
Here, lift your foot

116
00:08:32,160 --> 00:08:33,360
What is this old woman up to now

117
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:36,920
Nanny Qin, where are you taking me

118
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,240
Reporting to the princess consort

119
00:08:40,040 --> 00:08:43,520
This servant is showing you around the prince's residence

120
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:46,560
This way

121
00:08:51,880 --> 00:08:53,520
This old woman is truly malicious

122
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:54,920
If I stop now

123
00:08:55,400 --> 00:08:56,880
She'll know I can see

124
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:59,120
But if I keep walking

125
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:04,120
I'll find out whether you're truly blind or just pretending
